# Infrastructure notes: hosts, SSH commands, which key opens what.
#
# NOT secret in themselves — a public IP is public — but together they are a
# map of the estate, and a map is what turns one leaked credential into a
# tour. Kept beside the code so it is findable when you need it at 2am, and
# ignored so it never leaves this machine. Never remove this rule to "just
# commit it once".
.infra/
